  "label": "User projected onto the textual material",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the text 'wing wing wing' as the focal point of the meme's humor. The text is the primary element that triggers the user's interpretation of the absurdity, and the projection is onto this textual material rather than a specific visual or scene element. There are no explicit deictic pronouns like 'me' or 'you' in the image, but the user is implicitly projected onto the experience of encountering and interpreting the text overlay, which is the core of the meme's meaning.",
